      "scene": "late_night_studio",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "欢迎回到造片局，今天聊一个得罪人的话题：AI 主持人会不会抢走我们的饭碗。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "guest_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act03",
      "name": "第 3 幕",
      "scene": "backstage_neon",
      "camera": "pan_left",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "我先说结论：会抢走念稿的，抢不走临场反应的。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act04",
      "name": "第 4 幕",
      "scene": "neon_alley",
      "camera": "static",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "观众要的从来不是正确答案，而是被逗笑的那一下。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "guest_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act05",
      "name": "第 5 幕",
      "scene": "late_night_studio",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "所以别怕 AI，先怕自己写的稿子像 AI。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act06",
      "name": "第 6 幕",
      "scene": "backstage_neon",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "而且它不会累，凌晨三点还能给我写十个开场白。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "guest_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act07",
      "name": "第 7 幕",
      "scene": "neon_alley",
      "camera": "pan_left",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "可观众半夜打开电视，想看的不是完美，是有人陪。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act08",
      "name": "第 8 幕",
      "scene": "late_night_studio",
      "camera": "static",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "那就让 AI 写稿，让真人负责翻车和救场。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "guest_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
